 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-- **Boundary Pixels:** Pixels on the edge lack neighbors on one or more sides. The implementation checks bounds explicitly (`if (param.X - 1 >= 0 && param.X + 1 < param.GrayscaleImage.Width && param.Y - 1 >= 0 && param.Y + 1 < param.GrayscaleImage.Height)`) [S1, unofficial]. If out of bounds, it defaults to adding voxels from 0 to the computed height [S1, unofficial].
